      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 770274,
      "end_ms": 775154,
      "text": "不抱有任何，我不略想抱有任何幻想，I don't have any illusion about them。"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 776114,
      "end_ms": 779074,
      "text": "所以，呃，这种生活是不值得过的。"
